			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Output and Sky submodules with CHANGELOG rewrites\n\nSynchronize Output (471479a2→214a9ffb) and Sky (7fa66748→f87442b0) to latest downstream, bringing restructured CHANGELOG documentation for both components.\n\n- Output: Rewrite CHANGELOG to document v2.x release chain, adding v2.2 (ExposeWorkbenchAccessor transform, service-IIFE wrapping, Mountain→Cocoon buffer decoding), v2.1 (polyfill hardening, IPC adapter), and v2.0 (source compilation migration) sections.\n- Sky: Rewrite CHANGELOG.md with improved formatting and v2.2 entries documenting the bundled-electron correctness pass including sky:replay-events, channel-event bridge for terminal PTY, and search-result format migration to VS Code ≥1.92 schema.\n\nAligns documentation across Land components with the prose-style CHANGELOG format.",
