			"Message": "docs(Cocoon): Update CHANGELOG with v2.2 release and improved narrative\n\nSubmodule synchronization bringing Cocoon's CHANGELOG in line with Mountain's prose format. The v2.2 section documents the bundled-electron correctness pass: parent-PID watchdog for orphan detection, -32004 benign-404 classification for file-not-found errors, FileWatcher.Register benign classifier, and BuildOpenTextDocument UTF-8 decoding fix enabling positionAt for npm extension scripts.\n\nHistorical version entries (v2.1, v2.0, v1.3, v1.2, v1.1) have been restructured from bullet-point lists to narrative paragraphs explaining architectural motivation and impact of each release cycle.\n\nAligns with the prose-style CHANGELOG format established in Mountain, improving consistency across the Land project components.",
